{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28889","headline":"将归涂口宿郁林寺道玄上人院二首 二 · 许浑","name":"将归涂口宿郁林寺道玄上人院二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春寻采药翁，归路宿禅宫。\n云起客眠处，月残僧定中。\n藤花深洞水，槲叶满山风。\n清境不能住，朝朝慙远公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28889.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28889","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}